      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This bizarre misspelling of \"college\" as \"cool leg\" quickly became a fan favorite quote among English-speaking players. The joke would be lost in a straightforward translation, however, so the translator replaced it with a funny cultural reference that would make sense to Japanese players:",
